{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Keyboard is the most under utilized game controller.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In &quot;QWERTY Zombies&quot; you kill the zombies that walk on your keyboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The ultimate Whack-a-mole experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568720/extras/cut1.gif?t=1748207423\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The gameplay terrain is mapped to the keyboard. Every level introduces new gameplay elements that test your finger dexterity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568720/extras/cut2.gif?t=1748207423\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Some levels require you to master hand-eye coordination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568720/extras/cut3.gif?t=1748207423\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The quirky boss zombies will give you the best experience as you create music out of well-timed keystrokes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each level can be replayed to improve your stats and earn trophies. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568720/extras/cut4.png?t=1748207423\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The progression map has many forks. You can choose to solve the levels along different paths. Overall progress is guided by the locks and keys that make different paths inter-dependent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The demo is available for you to try. The game is still under development and your feedback is much appreciated. Also join the Discord to engage with the developer and the community.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3568720?t=1748207423","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3568720?t=1748207423","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568720/b435ac18c8322829989ae24819365b24716b66f8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748207423","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568720/b435ac18c8322829989ae24819365b24716b66f8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748207423","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"The game depicts frequently the killing of zombies with gory visual and sound effects. It shows weapons like guns, blades and flamethrowers."},"demos":[{"appid":3692510,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Keyboard is the most under utilized game controller.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In &quot;QWERTY Zombies&quot; you kill the zombies that walk on your keyboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The ultimate Whack-a-mole experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568720/extras/cut1.gif?t=1748207423\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The gameplay terrain is mapped to the keyboard. Every level introduces new gameplay elements that test your finger dexterity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568720/extras/cut2.gif?t=1748207423\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Some levels require you to master hand-eye coordination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568720/extras/cut3.gif?t=1748207423\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The quirky boss zombies will give you the best experience as you create music out of well-timed keystrokes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each level can be replayed to improve your stats and earn trophies. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568720/extras/cut4.png?t=1748207423\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The progression map has many forks. You can choose to solve the levels along different paths. Overall progress is guided by the locks and keys that make different paths inter-dependent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The demo is available for you to try. The game is still under development and your feedback is much appreciated. Also join the Discord to engage with the developer and the community.</p>","developers":["Blue Math"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568720/53515c8eccbea7c02ffe06b793407968d76f3ced/header.jpg?t=1748207423","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257145268,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257145268/movie480.mp4?t=1748205941","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257145268/movie_max.mp4?t=1748205941"},"name":"Demo release","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257145268/3df1a30cbd72cc764f52578e8001cf81b3edea22/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1748205941","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257145268/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1748205941","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257145268/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1748205941"}}],"name":"QWERTY Zombies","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 6100 or AMD FX-4350<br><